ASSETS DELIBERATELY EXCLUDED FROM THIS REPOSITORY
------------------------------------------------------------------------------

The following were evaluated and REMOVED before publication. They are recorded
here so the decision is auditable and is not silently reversed later.

Velara.vrm, Onyx.vrm, Dhahlia.vrm
  Author:  Nitral / Nitral Studios (2024), VRM 1.0
  Reason:  embedded metadata sets allowRedistribution = false and
           modification = "prohibited". The same metadata sets
           commercialUsage = "corporation", but commercial-use rights and
           redistribution rights are independent permission bits; the former
           does not grant the latter. The upstream repository has no LICENSE
           file, so no repo-level grant overrides the embedded prohibition.

greeting.vrma, greeting2.vrma, hello.vrma, model_pose.vrma, motion_pose.vrma,
peace_sign.vrma, shoot.vrma, show_full_body.vrma, spin.vrma
